body:
This PR adds a method `cancel` on a deferred function. We'll use it inside the `dispose` method of `InstantSearch` to prevent scheduled render to happen on an instance that is already disposed. Here is an example of its usage:

```js
const fn1 = defer(() => {
  console.log('Hello');
});

const fn2 = defer(() => {
  console.log('Bye');
});

fn1();
fn2();

fn1.cancel();

console.log('Start');
Promise.resolve().then(() => {
  console.log('Done');
});

// Output:
// Start
// Bye
// Done
```
